{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38382","headline":"敷水有丐者云是马侍中诸孙悯而有赠 · 吴融","name":"敷水有丐者云是马侍中诸孙悯而有赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天地尘昏九鼎危，大貂曾出武侯师。\n一心忠赤山河见，百战功名日月知。\n旧宅已闻栽禁树，诸孙仍见丐征岐。\n而今不要教人识，正藉将军死鬬时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}